    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The designer translates the jacket's rounded cut into a sculptural, architectural silhouette—an elegant shell shape with arched double handles. The clean, almost minimalist tailoring highlights geometric lines, while a bold B-shaped clasp serves as a striking focal point. The wraparound zipper opens like an oyster, a biomimetic touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/7489a26799cf005e.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/37e88505d0dacc06.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
