    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most distinctive feature is the oval base with a zippered exterior pocket, allowing the bag to be folded flat for storage—underscoring the natural, interactive relationship between the bag and the body.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/aa413079e709b945.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/f2e4fad843dfc5ea.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/1e2698210ec224fc.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/8c371a97e7ee2e0e.jpg",
      "alt": null,
