      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Design Details ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The body is crafted from cream calfskin, offering a glossy yet fine texture. Tone-on-tone stitching traces the contours, nearly invisible, for a minimalist and restrained aesthetic.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in: Tap to enlarge for an ultra-clear view.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The hardware is a highlight: four 'B'-shaped emblems at the junctions of handles and body mark the debut of the new brand insignia designed by Piccioli. Made of antique gold-toned metal with a polished finish, they catch the light with a fluid, golden shimmer.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in: Tap to enlarge for an ultra-clear view.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
