          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/7cc81134be8820a4.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The two zipper pulls are topped with metal rings that hang naturally, adding a playful, lively touch and a subtle flourish of detail.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/16e0658a12f32326.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/451280612e477d1c.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Detachable Strap ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag comes with arched double handles for hand or elbow carry, plus a detachable shoulder strap.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/ca3f9b6eda8d2082.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/18736774b81aac2a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "You'll notice the two opposing B-emblems are backed with rings, designed to attach the strap. The slim, cream calfskin strap allows for shoulder or crossbody wear, freeing your hands and adapting to a variety of looks.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
