    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· What Fits Inside ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Open the bag to reveal a contrasting biscuit-beige nappa lambskin lining. Its supple texture exudes luxury while gently protecting your belongings.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/9081a4f6df6f67e2.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ghqv9m7/4b75e54c79257fb3.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We packed a wallet, phone, travel perfume, keys, cardholder, tissues, and a notebook—everything for a day out. Despite its mini size and elongated shape, it feels light and easy to carry, never bulky or cumbersome.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
